      "edition": "SQL Server 2025 CU11, PostgreSQL 19.0 GA and 18.7, MySQL 9.7.4 LTS and 26.10 Innovation, MongoDB 9.0.8 checked 2026-11-20",
      "items": [
        "SQL Server 2025 (17.x) is current; CU11 is the latest listed cumulative update on 2026-11-20. Vector data type/functions are available in the engine; vector indexes and VECTOR_SEARCH remain preview in SQL Server 2025 and require PREVIEW_FEATURES. Azure SQL product/update-policy availability can differ.",
        "PostgreSQL 19.0 became generally available on 2026-11-19. PostgreSQL 18.7 is the latest 18.x minor update. PostgreSQL 19 major changes include concurrent REPACK, logical replication of sequence values, standby read-your-writes with WAIT FOR LSN, and INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO SELECT.",
        "MySQL 9.7.4 is the current LTS maintenance release and 26.10 the current Innovation release in the manual/release materials checked on 2026-11-20. These are distinct release tracks.",
